"connection. An administrator can turn it on to cut down on spam. When "
"greylisting is on, your box initially rejects mail from people you "
"haven&rsquo;t received mail from before. Legitimate mail servers attempt "
"redelivery shortly afterwards, but most spam does not. Mail from someone "
"new, such as a confirmation while you are registering on a website, can "
"then be delayed by at least 3 minutes, depending on when the remote "
"server retries."
